<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Assist</h1>
<p>Usage: 
</p>
<pre> assist &lt;character&gt;
</pre>
<p>You may help another player, or a creature, in a battle with this command. You will begin to fight whoever they are fighting.
</p><p>They must be fighting already, and you must not be: once you are in a fight yourself, you can't switch to assisting. If they are fighting a player, you can only assist when both you and that player have signed the Book of Blood.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Group</a>
</pre>




</div>